# /etc/lastroute-public-route/lastroute-public-route.env on VPS 2 (optional, root:lr-publicroute, mode 0640, never committed).
# The unit reads it with EnvironmentFile=- (a missing file is fine). Names only; set real values on the server, if any.
# A fixed seed keeps one world across restarts: add it to ExecStart as `--seed TEXT` (a drop-in file), it is not an env var.
# Where the process stores its device id (the directory's moderation check). The unit already sets HOME to this folder.
HOME=/var/lib/lastroute-public
